    exp06: red regression for the job-spec parse/hash window
    
    Codex round-3b finding 6: load_job_spec parses one read and hashes another, so a
    declaration substituted between them was admitted while the retained digest still
    identified the original bytes. The first case reproduces exactly that (the bound
    digest names the substituted file); the second requires that no later consumer
    re-hashes the spec instead of comparing against the bound snapshot.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
